{"4877260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Room 0", "steam_appid": 4877260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROOM 0</strong> is a short first-person horror game about an abandoned facility, a missing girl, and a place that should have never been opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a detective sent to investigate the disappearance of Carla. Her last known trace leads to a forgotten research site, sealed away after an incident no one seems willing to explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/5901509a6c352eefd2575ce1b831917c.poster.avif?t=1785365469\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/5901509a6c352eefd2575ce1b831917c.webm?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/5901509a6c352eefd2575ce1b831917c.mp4?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER THE FACILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building is silent, but not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old equipment still hums in the dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors lead to rooms that should have been cleared years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered through the facility are tapes, traces, and fragments of something that was never meant to leave the walls of Room 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only tool is a vintage <strong>VHS Camcorder</strong>, an artifact of the facility's past that now serves as your only window into its lethal present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/b83727b27a1f13e723fa1b635b1b2317.poster.avif?t=1785365469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/b83727b27a1f13e723fa1b635b1b2317.webm?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/b83727b27a1f13e723fa1b635b1b2317.mp4?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOLLOW CARLA'S TRACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carla entered the facility before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What she found inside is unclear. What remains of her investigation is scattered across the building, hidden in recordings and signs of movement where there should be none.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more you uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/66d01a0e51eb3b62c93ae016be5dfba9.poster.avif?t=1785365469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/66d01a0e51eb3b62c93ae016be5dfba9.webm?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/66d01a0e51eb3b62c93ae016be5dfba9.mp4?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMETHING GOT OUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility was closed for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The halls are quiet to the naked eye, but the air is thick with a presence that cannot be seen directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It watches from the darkness, and it reacts to your presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The threat is invisible to you, but through the lens of the camcorder, it is undeniable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To navigate the facility is to make a choice: trust your senses and remain blind, or raise the camera and bear witness to what is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/404f0a4154783f0f9cb1e6883ab7c9dd.poster.avif?t=1785365469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/404f0a4154783f0f9cb1e6883ab7c9dd.webm?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/404f0a4154783f0f9cb1e6883ab7c9dd.mp4?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person horror set inside an abandoned research facility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore, investigate and recover VHS recordings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Piece together the disappearance of Carla</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Avoid what still remains inside the building by managing your fear and your battery life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Analog-inspired visuals (VHS/CRT aesthetic), distorted spatial audio, and oppressive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A short horror experience focused on tension and mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room 0 was never meant to be opened.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROOM 0</strong> is a short first-person horror game about an abandoned facility, a missing girl, and a place that should have never been opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a detective sent to investigate the disappearance of Carla. Her last known trace leads to a forgotten research site, sealed away after an incident no one seems willing to explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/5901509a6c352eefd2575ce1b831917c.poster.avif?t=1785365469\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/5901509a6c352eefd2575ce1b831917c.webm?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/extras/5901509a6c352eefd2575ce1b831917c.mp4?t=1785365469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER THE FACILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building is silent, but not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old equipment still hums in the dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors lead to rooms that should have been cleared years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered through the facility are tapes, traces, and fragments of something that was never meant to leave the walls of Room 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only tool is a vintage <strong>VHS Camcorder</strong>, an artifact of the facility's past that now serves as your only window into its lethal present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla