 first-person horror game about a detective investigating an abandoned research facility, a missing girl named Carla, and the sealed room at the center of it all. Recover VHS tapes, follow the traces left behind, and avoid what still remains inside.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/6261792c0b56b6439abb99d5ad42def633fe18bd/header.jpg?t=1785365469", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/ac7f56b0c80edd4a04edc29ed3a8fbee68a8a912/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785365469", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4877260/ac7f56b0c80edd4a04edc29ed3a8fbee68a8a912/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785365469", "website": "https://roomzeroteam.pages.dev/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8350U / Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "r